
###Get all book
GET http://localhost:3001/books HTTP/1.1
Content-Type : Application/json

### create a book

POST http://localhost:3001/books HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title":"Indian History"
}

### update  a book
PUT http://localhost:3001/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title" : "Shiva"
}

#### Delete a book

DELETE http://localhost:3001/books/1
Content-Type: application/json